 Nov. 3 count if they arrive by then too.", "Mississippi has no automatic recount and no runoff in this race. A recount needs a court order."], "changed": {"since": "8:30 PM", "head": "Colom's chance held at >99%; most likely final margin Colom +10,400 to Colom +10,500.", "items": ["About 1,489 new votes were counted. The lead in counted votes went from Colom +2,654 to Colom +2,851. Most came from Madison (969 votes, Colom +123); Rankin (322 votes, Hyde-Smith +36); Panola (198 votes, Colom +110).", "AP changed its estimate of ballots left to count in 3 counties (25,750 to 24,700 statewide). Biggest effects: Rankin, 300 more (Hyde-Smith +25 pts there); Panola, 250 fewer (Colom +13 pts there); Madison, 1,100 fewer (Colom +1 pts there). Together these shift the expected outcome about 120 votes toward Hyde-Smith."]}, "votelog": {"since": "2026-11-04T09:29:13.386580-06:00", "rows": [{"t": "2026-11-10T21:00:07.283044-06:00", "new": 1516, "batch": 197, "lead": 2851, "pct_in": 97.8, "where": [{"n": "Madison", "v": 983, "m": 123}, {"n": "Rankin", "v": 329, "m": -36}, {"n": "Panola", "v": 204, "m": 110}], "more": 0}, {"t": "2026-11-10T20:30:07.108284-06:00", "new": 227, "batch": 83, "lead": 2654, "pct_in": 97.6, "where": [{"n": "Jones", "v": 227, "m": 83}], "more": 0}, {"t": "2026-11-10T20:00:07.255789-06:00", "new": 1071, "batch": -81, "lead": 2571, "pct_in": 97.5, "where": [{"n": "Rankin", "v": 640, "m": 32}, {"n": "Pearl River", "v": 354, "m": -123}, {"n": "Monroe", "v": 77, "m": 10}], "more": 0}, {"t": "2026-11-10T19:30:07.427890-06:00", "new": 178, "batch": -26, "lead": 2652, "pct_in": 97.4, "where": [{"n": "Prentiss", "v": 178, "m": -26}], "more": 0}, {"t": "2026-11-10T19:00:07.226454-06:00", "new": 3, "batch": -1, "lead": 2678, "pct_in": 97.4, "where": [{"n": "Choctaw", "v": 3, "m": -1}], "more": 0}, {"t": "2026-11-10T18:30:07.197351-06:00", "new": 52, "batch": 46, "lead": 2679, "pct_in": 97.4, "where": [{"n": "Tunica", "v": 52, "m": 46}], "more": 0}, {"t": "2026-11-10